+   *     @TT_MS_ID_XXX for a list of corresponding `encoding_id' values.
+   *     Note that most fonts contain a Unicode charmap using
+   *     (TT_PLATFORM_MICROSOFT, @TT_MS_ID_UNICODE_CS).
