+/*                                                                         */
+/*    PostScript Type 1 decoding routines (body).                          */
+/*                                                                         */
+/*  Copyright 2000-2011 by                                                 */
+/*  David Turner, Robert Wilhelm, and Werner Lemberg.                      */
